Optional same-language bypass uses separately installed Python dependencies:
langid.py (Marco Lui and Tim Baldwin, BSD-2-Clause): https://github.com/saffsd/langid.py
hanzidentifier (Thomas Roten, MIT): https://github.com/tsroten/hanzidentifier
Its zhon dependency supplies Chinese character data; dependency licenses and data
attribution remain in their own distributions. These packages, their language model
and character data are not copied into this module ZIP. Detection runs locally.
